translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_e276ab8a:

    # f "Aghhh!"
    f "啊——！"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_402ff8ca:

    # "Your hear a loud scream coming from above, it seems like that ball has caught Furkan by surprise."
    "你听到上方传来一声巨大的尖叫，看来那个球把富尔坎吓了一跳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_bf825b75:

    # r "I told you to stand aside while [e] is working his magic. Why won't you listen to me?"
    r "我不是告诉过你，在[e]施展魔法的时候要站到一边吗？你怎么就是不听？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_137292c7:

    # f "My apologies. I was almost rolled over by that boulder."
    f "抱歉。我差点被那块巨石压过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_6c2a4c5d:

    # "Rahim shakes his head as you awkwardly watch Furkan dust himself off."
    "雷希姆摇头 当你尴尬地看着弗坎把自己给打晕的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_5e28905f:

    # "Looks like a poor imitation of the other totems, the blue markings are dully faded, almost as if they were painted on."
    "看起来只是其他图腾的拙劣仿制品，蓝色的纹路暗淡褪色，几乎像是后来涂上去的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_dd794267:

    # "But you presume there are still some use for it."
    "不过，你猜它应该还是有点用处的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_3747827c:

    # "A loud thump can be heard as the stone door behind you slowly creaks open."
    "随着你身后的石门缓缓发出吱呀声打开，你听到一声沉重的闷响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_c09fb249:

    # s "Oh, I see. You are trying to open the door with the pillars."
    s "哦，我明白了。你是想用这些柱子打开门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_5d370d05:

    # e "Seb, I've already opened the door."
    e "塞布，我已经把门打开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_87d2c0f0:

    # s "Did you? Oh! You're the best, roomie, let's see what's in this room."
    s "你打开了？哦！你真棒，室友。我们看看这房间里有什么吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_08304699:

    # f "I certainly did not expect you to figure it out so soon, well done, [e]."
    f "我确实没想到你这么快就能想明白，干得漂亮，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_1dfcf0a8:

    # "Furkan smiles as he explores past the door."
    "弗坎在穿过门探索时微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_1d0d18f7:

    # f "Hmm... another locked door. We need some more totems here."
    f "嗯……又是一扇锁着的门。我们还需要更多图腾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_7c3c72c1:

    # f "I will explore the next chamber, Rahim."
    f "我会探索下一间房间,雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_980acb7f:

    # r "Go, go. Take [e] with you."
    r "去吧，去吧。带上[e]一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_470730e4:

    # "A ghostly spectral force seems to be blocking your path. You can feel its presence emanating around your body."
    "一股幽灵般的力量似乎挡住了你的去路。你能感觉到它的存在萦绕在身体周围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_eb344443:

    # "When you put down the last piece. A loud thump can be heard in front of you."
    "当你放下最后一块拼片时，前方传来一声沉闷的撞响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4a8722bb:

    # "The next thing you hear was Rahim's growl, its echo reverberating through the chamber, as if he was hit by a sudden force."
    "接下来你听到的就是雷希姆的咆哮, 它的回声在房间里回响, 好像他被突然的一股力量击中了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_d3d932de:

    # e "What was that?"
    e "刚才那是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_3785f832:

    # s "I don't know, Rahim practicing his daily whiny routine?"
    s "我不知道,雷希姆在练习他的日常吹笛游戏吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_90c6dfae:

    # "You turn around to see Furkan clutching at his horns, his eyes wide with shock."
    "你转过身去看弗坎 紧握着他的喇叭 他的眼睛被惊吓地睁大了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_10d05b53:

    # f "Something is messing with my head... [e], I am fine, but please go see if Rahim need anything."
    f "我脑子有问题,[e],我很好,但请去看看雷希姆需要什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_ea79e4ae:

    # "The golem stands alone in the corridor, it seems to be guarding the door in front of you."
    "魔像独自站在走廊里，似乎在守护你面前的那扇门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_cc2904a0:

    # s "Oh man, [e]. I still haven't done looking around these chambers, you're really good at thi-"
    s "哦，天哪，[e]。我还没来得及把这些房间都逛完呢，你解谜可真厉害——"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_410bf533:

    # "Sebas's voice is cut off as the door shuts in front of his face."
    "塞巴斯的话音未落，门就在他面前关上了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_7f5d28cd:

    # s "Uh... What's going on?"
    s "呃……怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_27058588:

    # s "[e]?"
    s "[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_fe9c57ab:

    # "You look at the golem, there is no way for you to escape if you anger it somehow."
    "你看着魔像，要是你不小心惹怒了它，根本无处可逃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_73f2aedb:

    # r "What's going on? Why can't you open it?"
    r "怎么回事？你为什么打不开？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4310a364:

    # s "Why can't You open it? I don't think it's working, Rahim."
    s "你为什么打不开？我觉得它不起作用，拉希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_dc037234:

    # e "Look, there is a guardian in front of me. I think it was a trap."
    e "看，前面有个守护者。我想这是个陷阱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_e27ebefe:

    # s "A guardian? We have to help him right now, Rahim."
    s "监护人 我们现在必须帮他 雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_232cd02b:

    # r "I am pushing the door, stop screaming."
    r "我正在推门，别喊了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_11d8a7ab:

    # s "Roomie, you can beat the guardian, okay. I've seen you do it before."
    s "室友，你能打败那个守护者的，好吗？我以前见你做到过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_98dbf641:

    # "Sebas shouts from the other side of the door."
    "塞巴斯在门的另一边喊道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4cb5765c:

    # e "Okay..."
    e "好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_c6f22ca4:

    # "You can feel the tension in the air as the golem's head seem to track your every movement."
    "空气中弥漫着紧张感，魔像的脑袋似乎随着你的一举一动转动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a3c2dbad:

    # f "We finally caught up to you, [e]. I have to say, you were brisking through the chambers like a bree-"
    f "我们终于追上你了，[e]。不得不说，你穿过这些房间的速度真快，简直像一阵风——"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_1127822e:

    # "Furkan's voice is cut off as the door shuts in front of his face."
    "弗坎的声音被切断 门关在他面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_bc6720fa:

    # f "I... I cannot open it. The door is sealed shut. Are you well, [e]?"
    f "我……我打不开。门被封死了。你还好吗，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_f1947183:

    # e "Yeah, I am, for now I guess."
    e "嗯，现在还好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_fe9c57ab_1:

    # "You look at the golem, there is no way for you to escape if you anger it somehow."
    "你看着魔像，要是你不小心惹怒了它，根本无处可逃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_73f2aedb_1:

    # r "What's going on? Why can't you open it?"
    r "怎么回事？你为什么打不开？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_5b7daec5:

    # f "I have no idea, the lever is stuck, and the totems do not even work."
    f "我也不知道，拉杆卡住了，图腾甚至完全不起作用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_dc037234_1:

    # e "Look, there is a guardian in front of me. I think it was a trap."
    e "看，前面有个守护者。我想这是个陷阱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_04d5e724:

    # f "A guardian? We have to help him right now, Rahim."
    f "监护人 我们现在必须帮他 雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4276c818:

    # r "I thought you had control of the guardians."
    r "我以为你能控制这些守护者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a5c8a2e5:

    # "Rahim's voice is low, almost a whisper."
    "雷希姆的声音低调,几乎低声低语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_77ae3b28:

    # f "They had not been ours ever since the primordial runes were stolen. We only had two guardians, we kept them in our tribe until they broke out of their chains."
    f "自从原初符文被盗，它们就不再受我们控制。我们原本只有两个守护者，把它们留在部族里，后来它们挣脱了锁链。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_6aa77912:

    # f "As a matter of fact, [e] slain both of them eventually."
    f "事实上，最后还是[e]把它们两个都杀了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_0c67279f:

    # r "Then what is this one doing here?"
    r "那这个又是怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_e465354b:

    # f "It was me. We had the basin to create new guardians, but they had stolen the basin from me."
    f "是我弄出来的。我们有个用来制造新守护者的石盆，可他们把石盆从我这里偷走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_c6f22ca4_1:

    # "You can feel the tension in the air as the golem's head seem to track your every movement."
    "空气中弥漫着紧张感，魔像的脑袋似乎随着你的一举一动转动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_62e2ac42:

    # e "Do I have to kill it, he's blocking the way and I have no way out."
    e "我得杀了它吗？它挡住了去路，我也无路可逃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_f1b23d70:

    # f "I believe in you, [e]. Do whatever you must."
    f "我相信你，[e]。放手去做吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_98aee4f8:

    # r "You can't just let [e] kill the guardian by himself. Be useful for once."
    r "你不能就这么让[e]一个人杀守护者。也该帮上点忙了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_b0358175:

    # "Rahim tries to push open the door, you can see a faint glow between the door but he quickly runs out of energy."
    "雷希姆试图推开门, 你可以看见门之间有微弱的光芒, 但他很快就耗尽了能量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_f4eed14b:

    # r "...What?"
    r "……什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_f0ba47e6:

    # "Rahim shouts in exasperation, but Furkan says nothing in return."
    "雷希姆在愤怒中喊叫,但弗坎却不说任何回报。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_5eb778fe:

    # r "Scream out if you need help, [e]. We'll be right here."
    r "需要帮忙就喊一声，[e]。我们就在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_fda24498:

    # e "Okay, I'll try."
    e "好，我试试。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_214d47ee:

    # "You take a deep breath and prepare yourself for the worst."
    "你深吸一口气，做好了迎接最坏结果的准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4a09958b:

    # "As you lift up the totem, a hazy bleam washes over your entire body. You feel a sudden chill, as if the air around you has been sucked dry."
    "当你举起图腾时，一道朦胧的光束掠过全身。你突然感到一阵寒意，仿佛周围的空气都被抽干了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_460017e5:

    # "Rahim stares at you in disbelief. The totem in your hand seems to be the cause of his sudden discomfort. Instinctively, you put down the totem."
    "拉希姆难以置信地盯着你。你手中的图腾似乎正是他突然不适的原因。你本能地放下了图腾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_7208c0ca:

    # r "You alright?"
    r "你还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_54b57889:

    # e "I'm fine, just a little cold."
    e "我没事，只是有点冷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_8150b6c2:

    # r "You disappeared for a moment there. I thought you were going to vanish."
    r "你刚才有一瞬间消失了。我还以为你要不见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a41cad54:

    # e "Did I? I didn't feel anything."
    e "我吗？我什么感觉都没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_be7f28a1:

    # r "Pick it up again."
    r "再把它捡起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a86d166b:

    # "You hesitantly pick up the totem again. The same glow washes over you, but this time Rahim seems to be more certain of his theory."
    "你犹豫不决地又拿起图腾。同样的光芒冲洗你身上,但这次雷希姆似乎更肯定他的理论。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_358a9a00:

    # r "Must be the totem, it's turning you invisible... Go see if you can do something about it."
    r "一定是图腾的缘故，它让你隐形了……去看看你能不能想办法解决。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_97a1151f:

    # e "You can't see me?"
    e "你看不见我了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_472d96aa:

    # r "No, but I can feel you, somewhat. You're still here, just... invisible."
    r "看不见，但我多少还能感觉到你。你还在这儿，只是……隐形了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_b5735e30:

    # e "I'll see what I can do."
    e "我去看看能不能做点什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_569d8924:

    # r "And... don't even try to scare me, or do anything weird around me. I'll bite your arm off."
    r "还有……别想吓我，也别在我身边做什么奇怪的事。不然我会把你的胳膊咬下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_c35f6ab8:

    # "You gulp nervously. His eyes seem to track at your general direction, but you can tell he can't find your exact direction."
    "你紧张地咽了口唾沫。他的目光似乎跟随着你大致所在的方向，但你看得出来，他找不到你的确切位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a6ab4621:

    # "You can't drop the totem here."
    "你不能在这里放下图腾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_57c4e555:

    # "It seems that the lever is supposed to reset the boulder, but something is blocking the way."
    "看来这个拉杆本该让巨石复位，但有东西挡住了去路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_57c4e555_1:

    # "It seems that the lever is supposed to reset the boulder, but something is blocking the way."
    "看来这个拉杆本该让巨石复位，但有东西挡住了去路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_d98a02d9:

    # "A metal gate cage that blocks the way. It seems to be locked, but you can't see any keyhole or any other way to open it."
    "一扇挡住去路的金属栅门。它似乎锁上了，但你看不到钥匙孔，也找不到其他打开它的办法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_52063953:

    # "The thin bars suggest that something slimmer perhaps can pass through the cage."
    "栅栏的间隙很窄，或许只有更纤细的东西才能穿过这道门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_e6d22e0b:

    # msg "Work in Progress!"
    msg "开发中！"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_dfcbb64b:

    # "You walk up to the brown bull, who is standing near the stone wall."
    "你走近站在石墙旁的棕色公牛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_129465a5:

    # "Rahim looks at your direction with a curious expression, but he doesn't say anything."
    "雷希姆用奇怪的表情看着你的方向 但他什么也不说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_da4ca6d3:

    # "It is rousing to look at his body and the way he stands, without having to worry about his fastidious gaze as you do so."
    "不用担心他那苛刻的目光，你可以放心观察他的身躯和站姿，着实令人振奋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_fc01a3b7:

    # "Though, he is looking increasingly annoyed at your presence, or lack thereof."
    "不过，他似乎越来越恼火于你的出现——或者说，你的缺席。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4aad495b:

    # r "I still cannot believe this temple was built underneath our feet for so many years, it is a wonder that we have never found it before."
    r "我还是不敢相信，这座神殿就在我们脚下存在了这么多年。真奇怪，我们以前竟从没发现过它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_b7dd3efd:

    # e "What were we supposed to do again?"
    e "我们刚才到底要做什么来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_58b2b147:

    # r "Find your way into the grand chamber. I think we need to look for the totems first. That mural over there would be a good start."
    r "找到通往大殿的路。我想我们得先找图腾。那边的壁画会是个不错的起点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_c65b5244:

    # r "This stone just fell from the ceiling. Think you can do something with it?"
    r "这块石头刚从天花板掉下来。你觉得能拿它做点什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_5635f5c4:

    # r "The door's unlocked. We better get moving."
    r "门没锁。我们最好赶紧走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_56be0317:

    # r "Another door blocking our way, maybe these pillars have something to do with it."
    r "又有一扇门挡住了去路，也许这些柱子和它有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_b103519d:

    # r "Two pressure plates here that only works with totems."
    r "这里有两个只能用图腾启动的压力板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_93616273:

    # r "You need to find more totems, [e]. Or, try to look for the first one you left behind."
    r "你得再找些图腾，[e]。或者，去找找你之前落下的那一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_1059d874:

    # "You nod sheepishly."
    "你不好意思地点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a882d2a7:

    # r "Door's opened. Let's go then."
    r "门开了。那我们走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_dddc8eb6:

    # e "Hey, Rahim. Do you think you can help me with the puzzle...?"
    e "嘿,雷希姆,你能帮我解谜吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_0e35e649:

    # "The bull looks at you, his eyes narrowing at the boulder."
    "公牛看向你，目光落在巨石上，双眼微微眯起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_61aa3606:

    # r "Obviously, you need that totem that makes you invisible. Think you can roll that rock down in the hall?"
    r "显然，你需要那块能让你隐形的图腾。你觉得能把那块石头滚到走廊下面吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4f2c036e:

    # r "I can see something glowing blue over the gate, maybe the other totem of yours can be useful."
    r "我能看到栅门上方有蓝光，也许你的另一块图腾能派上用场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_e4f18f5c:

    # r "And here is the journal. Keep it safe." nointeract
    r "还有，这是那本日志。保管好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_c3a50df6:

    # "Sebas does not even notice your presence as a ghostly form, he just looks ahead."
    "塞巴斯甚至没注意到你幽灵般的身影，只是直直地望着前方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_2c7749ae:

    # "You try to talk to him, but he doesn't seem to hear you."
    "你试着和他说话，但他似乎听不见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_057e1e19:

    # s "What's this mural about, you think?"
    s "你觉得这幅壁画讲的是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4e1fa295:

    # s "I can see the guardian there, a goat here... is that Tapjoo?"
    s "我能看到那边有个守护者，这里有只山羊……那是塔普乔吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_68326c35:

    # e "Looks like it."
    e "看起来是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_67cb8f41:

    # "Sebas looks at the mural, his eyes scanning the stone wall."
    "塞巴斯看着壁画，目光扫过石墙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_9a1def53:

    # s "How about that one, a deer... or elk."
    s "那一个呢？是鹿……还是麋鹿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_5acf1e4b:

    # e "He seems familiar. Have I seen that one before?"
    e "它看起来有点眼熟。我以前见过它吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_20ea60be:

    # s "What's that noise behind the mural..."
    s "壁画后面那是什么声音……"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_d848f9c8:

    # s "The door's unlocked. Come on, roomie, we gotta see what's the next room."
    s "门没锁。走吧，室友，我们得去看看下一间房。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_86670697:

    # "The lion smiles, pointing to the direction of the exit."
    "狮子微笑着，指向出口的方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_7430e08c:

    # s "Are those the goats... Now I wish Rahim'd invited Furkan here, because I have no idea what any of those mean."
    s "我希望雷希姆邀请富坎来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_984fe789:

    # e "Yeah, me neither."
    e "对，我也没见过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4e186538:

    # s "Like, what is that one even doing there? There's not even hints in these damn puzzles. What were the builders thinking..."
    s "话说，那个到底为什么会在那里？这些该死的谜题连一点提示都没有。建造者当时到底是怎么想的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_2a941dcd:

    # s "They drew very well, though. Like the mural over there."
    s "不过，他们画得真不错。就像那边的壁画。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_e3c559f4:

    # s "Go, go! We need to go down that chamber here."
    s "走，走！我们得从这里下到那间房里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_3758c1bf:

    # "Sebas looks at the tables in the scriptorium, his eyes scanning the papers."
    "塞巴斯看着抄写室里的桌子，目光扫过纸张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_6aa6cd0d:

    # s "What are those about?"
    s "那些是做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_2e18b601:

    # e "I don't know, but they look like some kind of ancient texts."
    e "不知道，但看起来像某种古代文献。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_59887de4:

    # s "I can see some symbols here, but I can't read them like the goats do."
    s "我能看到一些符号，但不像山羊那样读得懂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_1eb00502:

    # s "We should keep an eye on them though, someone else can probably translate those."
    s "不过我们应该留意着它们，说不定别人能把它们翻译出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_b33596b5:

    # e "Hey Sebas, think you can help with the stones lying around here?"
    e "嘿，塞巴斯，你能帮忙处理一下这里散落的石头吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a00bf878:

    # "He turns around and look at the rounded boulders, furrowing his brows."
    "他转过身看着那些圆滚滚的巨石，眉头紧锁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_369aa17a:

    # s "Just push the balls in the hole, right?"
    s "只要把这些球推进洞里，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_7323cca5:

    # "The lion points at the other hole. He scratches his head lightly."
    "狮子指向另一个洞，轻轻挠了挠头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_7773a6b1:

    # s "How about that hole? Do you think you can fill that one?"
    s "那另一个洞呢？你觉得能把它也填上吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_0067d8dd:

    # s "Just pull the lever if you mess something up."
    s "要是弄错了，就拉一下那个拉杆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_dcabe69d:

    # s "Uhmm, use some totems?"
    s "呃……用几个图腾？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_8901f5be:

    # s "I don't know, I'm getting stuck here, [e]."
    s "我不知道，我卡在这里了，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_23af322a:

    # e "Me too, Seb."
    e "我也是，塞布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_96568e97:

    # s "Uhmm, totem?"
    s "呃……图腾？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_5ed423da:

    # s "We should go down there. I think we need to find the other totem."
    s "我们应该下去。我觉得得找到另一块图腾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_620bee98:

    # "The chamber is filled with the smell of incense and the sound of the wind. The lion stands near the stone wall."
    "房间里弥漫着香的气味，风声在其中回荡。狮子站在石墙旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_e432ed41:

    # s "I'm just looking around... roomie. I don't think I'm solving these puzzles in the next ten years. I'm counting on you, [e]."
    s "我就随便看看……室友。我觉得再过十年也解不开这些谜题。全靠你了，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_2e6bf189:

    # "You walk up to the white ram in your ghostly form, but he just looks ahead, not even registering your presence."
    "你以幽灵般的形态走近白色公羊，但他只是望着前方，完全没有察觉到你的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_31050d27:

    # "Despite your best efforts, he doesn't seem to notice you, at least you do not believe he's willfully trying to ignore you."
    "尽管你竭尽全力，他似乎还是没注意到你；至少，你不认为他是在故意无视你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_5ae746e7:

    # f "Look at this mural, it is beautiful. Is this truly how Tapjoo looked like?"
    f "看看这幅壁画，真美。这就是塔普乔真正的模样吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_6fa4f8fd:

    # e "He looks just like one of the goats."
    e "他看起来就像山羊中的一员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_9d220850:

    # "The goat chief stands in front of the stone mural, the brilliant colours of the mural reflecting off his fur."
    "山羊首领站在石壁画前，壁画绚丽的色彩映照在他的毛发上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_28d3a45c:

    # f "So mesmerising. I cannot pull my eyes away from it."
    f "太迷人了。我根本移不开视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_828bd9f5:

    # e "It's nice... but, it looks like a mess, doesn't it?"
    e "挺好看的……不过，看起来一团糟，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_c3404a21:

    # f "A beautiful mess indeed. But yes, the mural is ostensibly out of order. The maker must have intended it to be so."
    f "确实是一团美丽的混乱。不过，这幅壁画显然是故意打乱顺序的。制作者一定就是这么设计的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_b091e30e:

    # "You furrow your brow, trying to make sense of Furkan's words. The ram's idle gaze looks as if he is lost in thought."
    "你梳眉角,试图理解弗坎的话。 公羊无所事事的目光看起来好像他迷糊了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_303145f4:

    # f "I think I heard something in the back. Did you find anything?"
    f "我好像听到后面有动静。你发现什么了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a3d72403:

    # f "We should go, I... I would loathe staying here for one more second."
    f "我们该走了，我……我可不想再在这里多待一秒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_15b17584:

    # "The ram's eyes fuzz with a hint of fear, his gaze darting around the mural as if he is expecting something to jump out at him."
    "公羊的眼中掠过一丝恐惧，目光在壁画周围来回游移，仿佛在担心有什么东西会突然跳出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_e2dcf424:

    # f "Do you see the pillars? They are all faces of our people, albeit more abstractly."
    f "你看到那些柱子了吗？上面全是我们族人的脸，只是表现得更抽象一些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_f9cb2b5b:

    # e "They are not all goats, are they?"
    e "他们不全是山羊，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a284cc7b:

    # f "No, some are antlered, some are horned, they all belonged in our tribe."
    f "不，有些长着鹿角，有些长着犄角，但他们都属于我们的部族。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a0d6ef15:

    # f "There is a pattern here, somewhere. Maybe we have missed something about these folks."
    f "这里一定隐藏着某种规律。也许我们漏看了这些人的某些特征。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_1f0b8860:

    # f "We should explore the chamber down there. Rahim will stay to watch over this one."
    f "我们应该探索下面的大厅 雷希姆会留下来照看这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_1516e65f:

    # "The goat chief stands besides the tables in the scriptorium, skimming through the paper curiously."
    "山羊首领站在抄写室的桌子旁，好奇地翻阅着纸张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_01c715cc:

    # "You look at the ram, he places his hand on the pages, his eyes scanning the texts."
    "你看向公羊，他把手放在书页上，目光扫过那些文字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_756221e9:

    # e "What are those about?"
    e "那些是做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_129646ba:

    # f "Huh... I have not read these scripts before, but someone scratched out some of the texts."
    f "嗯……这些文字我以前没读过，不过有人把其中一些内容划掉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_7950ea65:

    # e "Oh, really?"
    e "哦，真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_9cb47f5d:

    # "You try to look at the texts, only to be confused by the foreign symbols of ancient languages."
    "你试着看那些文字，却被古代语言的陌生符号弄得一头雾水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_5204ef83:

    # f "It reads, the flock is notably skilled with intelligence, but they are also notably susceptible to psychiatric influence."
    f "上面写着：羊群在智力方面格外出众，但也特别容易受到精神影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_8783cbf8:

    # f "Instinctively, the flock follows a bellwether, and the bellwether follows the shepherd, Tapjoo..."
    f "羊群会本能地跟随头羊，而头羊则跟随牧羊人塔普乔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_d3305cba:

    # f "Something... and... the horns of a Tapjoo's follower is where they may heed the echos of the bell-... I can't read the rest in these dim light."
    f "还有些什么……以及……塔普乔追随者的角，是他们聆听钟声回响的地方——……这昏暗的光线让我看不清剩下的内容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_1e63012f:

    # "You look at Furkan, who seems to be lost in thought. His hand unwittingly brushes against the bell on his chest."
    "你看看弗坎,他似乎在思想上迷失了方向,他的手在无意中刷在胸前的钟声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_489a9c74:

    # e "Furkan, what's a bellwether?"
    e "弗坎,什么是钟声?"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_fe9dcd72:

    # f "The leading sheep of the flock... I thin-... Are we truly seeking our deity Tapjoo here?"
    f "羊群中的头羊……我想——……我们真的要在这里寻找我们的神明塔普乔吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_797a82dc:

    # f "It seemed so impossible, we have not found any traces of him since... primordial times."
    f "这实在难以置信，我们自太初时代以来……就再也没发现过他的任何踪迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_8ebe52c9:

    # e "I don't know, but the mayor has written something about the shepherd, do you think the shepherd is Tapjoo?"
    e "我不知道，不过市长写过一些关于牧羊人的内容。你觉得那个牧羊人就是塔普乔吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_75713fe2:

    # f "Who else can it be? He was the only one capable to build all of this. That mural at the entrance, it did something to me, I have been hearing the bell's chime since then."
    f "不可能是别人了。他是唯一有能力建造这一切的人。入口处那幅壁画对我产生了某种影响，从那以后，我一直听见铃铛的响声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_afea7752:

    # "You look at the ram, his eyes are wide with shock."
    "你看向公羊，他的双眼因震惊而睁得大大的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_555e6c59:

    # f "Go, [e]. The sooner we find out about Tapjoo, the sooner we can leave this place."
    f "走吧，[e]。我们越早弄清塔普乔的事，就能越早离开这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_b2518f7a:

    # e "Hey Furkan, think you can help with the stones lying around here?"
    e "嘿 弗坎 你能帮我处理这周围的石头吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a00bf878_1:

    # "He turns around and look at the rounded boulders, furrowing his brows."
    "他转过身看着那些圆滚滚的巨石，眉头紧锁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4b3ed171:

    # f "Try to push them around, maybe towards that hole over there."
    f "试着把它们推到别处，也许推向那边的洞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4cddb571:

    # "The brown ram points at the other hole. He scratches his head lightly."
    "棕色公羊指向另一个洞，轻轻挠了挠头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_6087cb5d:

    # f "You need to fill up the other hole as well. That totem might be useful here."
    f "你还得把另一个洞也填上。那块图腾或许能派上用场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_df91b838:

    # f "If you messed up you can always use the lever over there."
    f "要是弄错了，你随时可以使用那边的拉杆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_bf2c8767:

    # e "Oh! You are right, I should try that. You're really quick at figuring out these ones, Furkan."
    e "哦！你说得对，我应该试试。富尔坎，你解决这些谜题可真快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_ee9fb24a:

    # f "We goats are the masters of puzzles, [e]. I have seen a lot of things."
    f "我们山羊可是解谜大师，[e]。我见过的东西多着呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_87b9f418:

    # f "Another gate, I saw you pass through the gate so easily back at the entrance, correct?"
    f "又一道栅门。我看到你在入口处轻轻松松就穿过了那道门，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_deab20d0:

    # e "I did, but I don't have the totem with me..."
    e "是的，可我没带着那块图腾……"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_064fa79b:

    # f "Maybe you should use that instead, then."
    f "那你也许该改用那个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a15a5990:

    # "Furkan smiles."
    "弗坎笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4c3ae559:

    # f "There must be something you are not seeing."
    f "你一定漏看了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_e209a426:

    # f "Try using your totems, that might help."
    f "试试使用你的图腾，或许会有帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_9c09fbc5:

    # "Quietly, Furkan returns to read the ancient texts and books."
    "弗坎静静地返回读古书和古书。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_4410c608:

    # f "We should go, now that we have three totems to spare."
    f "我们该走了，现在我们有三块图腾备用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_a7157aee:

    # f "I do not mean to complain, but the boulder almost crushed me. I need to rest about."
    f "我不是想抱怨，但那块巨石差点把我压扁。我得休息一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_ac3048bc:

    # "The chamber is filled with the smell of incense and the sound of the wind. The white ram stands near the stone wall."
    "房间里弥漫着香的气味，风声在其中回荡。白色公羊站在石墙旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_0925ddc8:

    # f "This sanctum is damp, and eerie. I can feel something else in here. Especially when you walk with that totem..."
    f "这座圣所又潮湿又阴森。我能感觉到这里还有别的东西。尤其是你拿着那块图腾时……"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_of_Tapjoo_Loop_f158c014:

    # f "But I took a look to the area down there, am I dreaming or did our ancestor design a weirdly phallic shape."
    f "但我看了看下面那片区域——是我在做梦，还是我们的祖先设计了一个形状怪异得像阳具的东西？"
